        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: نوکری",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "نوکری — naukrī — \"a job\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "نوکری (naukrī) is naukar, \"servant\", with the ending -ī that makes a noun. naukar is usually traced to Persian naukar, which Persian took from Mongolic nökör, \"companion\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
